      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "interface-frame-smoke"
        },
        "markdown": "## Node Composition Smoke Matrix\n\n| Level | Root Port | Action Port |\n|---|---|---|\n| Detail | Explicitly delegates to Shared Detail | Owns Action Detail |\n| Summary | Falls back to Shared Summary | Owns Action Summary |\n| Icon | Shared Icon | Shared Icon |\n| Glyph | Shared Glyph | Shared Glyph |\n\n### Existing proof\n\n- Edit mode projects the interface frame.\n- Root navigation focuses Shared Detail through `default-view`.\n- Root and Action project as widget Ports.\n\n### New proof target\n\nSemantic zoom and addressed Port entry must resolve the matrix above while preserving the active Port identity."
      }
    }
